<div class="about">
    <p>
        CCMusic Search is a simple search engine for
        <a href="https://creativecommons.org/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Creative Commons</a> music.
        It uses public APIs to find music released under CC on
        <a href="https://www.jamendo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jamendo</a>,
        <a href="https://ccmixter.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ccMixter</a>,
        <a href="https://archive.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Internet Archive</a>,
        <a href="https://freesound.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Freesound</a>,
        the <a href="https://www.loc.gov/collections/national-jukebox/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Library of Congress</a> and
        <a href="https://www.europeana.eu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Europeana</a>.
        Code is open source and available on
        <a href="https://github.com/antodippo/ccmusicsearch-v2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
